<title>JAPAN: Moody's raises Suruga Bank deposit rating.</title>
<headline>Moody's raises Suruga Bank deposit rating.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Thursday that it had raised Suruga Bank Ltd's deposit rating to A2/P-1 and the bank's financial strength rating to C.  </p>
<p>Suruga Bank's previous deposit rating was Baa1/P-2 and its financial strength rating was D, Moody's said in a statement.</p>
<p>The rating changes reflect Suruga Bank's relatively strong core profitability as well as its good capital position relative to the scale of its non-performing loan exposure, Moody's said.</p>
</text>
